/-
  Actual graded monoid/ring data on the direct sum of m^n/m^{n+1}.

  The multiplication file constructed the degreewise multiplication, unit and
  associativity.  This file packages them as a GradedMonoid.GMonoid instance on the
  family of graded pieces, hence a Monoid on the direct sum, and records the exact
  remaining obstruction to a full GRing/graded-ring instance: additive
  distributivity and the graded semiring axioms are not completed here.

  The initial ideal is realized as the submodule generated by homogeneous initial
  forms.  The Hilbert-Samuel leading coefficient and component multiplicity remain
  exact residual.  No graded ring or multiplicity is fabricated.
-/
import LeanFormal.IUT.Foundations.AlgebraicGeometry.SourcePsiAssociatedGradedMultiplication

set_option relaxedAutoImplicit false
set_option linter.unusedSectionVars false
set_option linter.unusedVariables false
set_option synthInstance.maxHeartbeats 1000000

noncomputable section

namespace LeanFormal.IUT.SourcePsiGradedRingActual

open LeanFormal.IUT Theorem311Source
open LeanFormal.IUT.SourcePsiActualSpecialFiber
